{
  "slug": "xilinx-suite",
  "name": "Xilinx Suite",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "An AI coding skill (Claude Code / Codex / OpenClaw) that turns natural language into production-ready Vivado / Vitis HLS / Vitis Unified / PetaLinux scripts. Describe what you want to build, and get runnable Tcl, XDC, shell scripts, and C/C++ templates -- covering the complete FPGA/MPSoC design flow from HLS algorithm to boot image.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `xilinx-suite` (Xilinx 全工具链综合助手，覆盖从零到一的完整 FPGA/MPSoC 工程构建，包括： - Vivado：硬件设计、Block Design、IP 配置、XDC 约束、综合实现、比特流生成 - Vitis HLS：C/C++ 高层次综合，生成自定义 IP 核 - Vitis Unified…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install xilinx-suite@claude-community` from `QingquanYao/xilinx-skill` (`plugins/xilinx-suite`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
